  <section><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Draft — not legally approved</p><h1>Website terms (draft)</h1><p class="notice">These draft terms require review by the business owner and legal counsel before launch; they are not an approved legal agreement.</p><h2>Information only</h2><p>Website content and illustrations are general information, not a property listing, binding offer, valuation, legal advice or guarantee of sale. Neighborhood illustrations do not depict official boundaries.</p><h2>Inquiries</h2><p>Submitting a form requests a conversation; it does not create a purchase or brokerage relationship or commit either party to a transaction. Please submit only information you have authority to share.</p><h2>Operator details</h2><p>This website is operated by Anthony Villar, an individual doing business as CashForPhilly, 1100 E Hector St, Suite 419, Conshohocken, PA; <a href="mailto:contact@cashforphilly.com">contact@cashforphilly.com</a>; 215-290-7666. Anthony Villar is a licensed Pennsylvania real estate salesperson, license RS340087.</p><h2>How transactions work</h2><p>CashForPhilly does not list or market properties as a broker through this site. It may enter into purchase contracts with sellers and may assign those contracts to end buyers, including through New Western's Investor Marketplace. In such a case the operator holds a contractual interest in the property, not title, and may be compensated by an assignment fee. Sellers should read any contract carefully and may consult an attorney or other adviser before signing.</p><h2>Governing law</h2><p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Commonwealth of Pennsylvania.</p></div></section>
